:INFO
Art. 106 Collection of fines and costs and prescription
1 The fines and costs imposed in the criminal proceedings in respect of tax offences are collected in accordance with Articles 86–90. Article 36 SCC applies.
2 Prescription of the right to collect fines and costs are governed by Article 91.
|

:NOTE
Para. 1 — SR 311.0

